{"id":"n59560-3-7","stage":3,"title":"복사 · 复制","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59560-3-7-1","ko":"와, 이런 자료는 어디서 구할 수 있어?","zh":"哇，这种资料是在哪儿能找到的啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자료는","meaning":"资料","explanation":"자료：资料；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62401","senseId":"1","lemma":"자료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구할","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"6416867e47259489","term":"자료","zh":"资料","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3","entryId":"62401","definition":"做研究或调查最基本的材料。","pronunciation":["자료"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"找，弄，求","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"为得到需要的东西而寻找；或指寻找以求得到。","pronunciation":["구하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8182922e7ab2863bae68.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59560-3-7-2","ko":"친구 컴퓨터에서 복사를 해 온 거야.","zh":"是从朋友电脑上拷贝过来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컴퓨터에서","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"복사를","meaning":"复制，拷贝","explanation":"복사：复制，拷贝；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"복사","audio":"/audio/37b3d3b11b2637f6449d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59560","senseId":"3","lemma":"복사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"37b3d3b11b2637f6","term":"복사","zh":"复制，拷贝","audio":"/audio/37b3d3b11b2637f6449d.mp3","entryId":"59560","definition":"在电脑上制作一模一样的文件放到其他地方。","pronunciation":["복싸"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/cdfe603028e5a7d52044.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59560","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","